@startuml
[*] --> CreateAccount

state CreateAccount as "Create Account"
CreateAccount : entry / User starts creating account
CreateAccount : do / Fill in details and submit
CreateAccount : exit / Account created successfully

state WatchVideos as "Watch Videos"
WatchVideos : entry / User watches videos
WatchVideos : do / View video content
WatchVideos : exit / Continue watching or leave

state UploadVideo as "Upload Video"
UploadVideo : entry / User uploads a video
UploadVideo : do / Select and upload file
UploadVideo : exit / Video uploaded successfully

state SaveVideo as "Save Video"
SaveVideo : entry / User saves a video
SaveVideo : do / Add to likes list
SaveVideo : exit / Video saved in likes list

state ViewSavedVideos as "View Saved Videos"
ViewSavedVideos : entry / User views saved videos
ViewSavedVideos : do / Retrieve and display saved videos
ViewSavedVideos : exit / Continue viewing or leave

state EnterDiscussion as "Enter Discussion"
EnterDiscussion : entry / User enters discussion option
EnterDiscussion : do / Post comments or reply to others
EnterDiscussion : exit / Continue discussing or leave

WatchVideos --> [*] : [Leave]
UploadVideo --> [*] : [Cancel]
SaveVideo --> [*] : [Remove from likes list]
ViewSavedVideos --> [*] : [Clear saved videos]
EnterDiscussion --> [*] : [Exit discussion]

@enduml
